{"id":"b77e5a3eaec72006","group":"58","path":"58/batch09/58-df-zfc-measure3-finite-measure.md","title":"ZFC Measure3 Finite Measure","display":"df-zfc-measure3-finite-measure — ZFC Measure3 Finite Measure","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-df-zfc-measure3-finite-measure","aliases":["58-df-zfc-measure3-finite-measure"],"display":"df-zfc-measure3-finite-measure — ZFC Measure3 Finite Measure","depends_on":["[[../batch13/58-df-measure.md]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-df-zfc-measure3-finite-measure"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-df-zfc-measure3-finite-measure</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-zfc-measure3-finite-measure — ZFC Measure3 Finite Measure"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"ca832ed6bc22f728\" href=\"?note=ca832ed6bc22f728\" title=\"../batch13/58-df-measure.md\">../batch13/58-df-measure.md</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"X,\\Sigma,\\mu \\in V\">\\(X,\\Sigma,\\mu \\in V\\)</span></li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Measure}_S\\subseteq V^3\">\\(\\mathrm{Measure}_S\\subseteq V^3\\)</span>（见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"ca832ed6bc22f728\" href=\"?note=ca832ed6bc22f728\" title=\"../batch13/58-df-measure.md\">../batch13/58-df-measure.md</a>）</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ZfcMeasure3FiniteMeasure}_S \\subseteq V^3\">\\(\\mathrm{ZfcMeasure3FiniteMeasure}_S \\subseteq V^3\\)</span></li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}measure3\\text{-}finite\\text{-}measure} \\vdash \\mathrm{ZfcMeasure3FiniteMeasure}_S(X,\\Sigma,\\mu)\\leftrightarrow \\mathrm{Measure}_S(\\mu,X,\\Sigma)\\land \\mu(X)&lt;\\infty\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}measure3\\text{-}finite\\text{-}measure} \\vdash \\mathrm{ZfcMeasure3FiniteMeasure}_S(X,\\Sigma,\\mu)\\leftrightarrow \\mathrm{Measure}_S(\\mu,X,\\Sigma)\\land \\mu(X)&lt;\\infty\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>有限测度是总空间具有有限测度的测度；测度的函数性、空集值和可列可加性由 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Measure}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{Measure}_S\\)</span> 保证。</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"../batch13/58-df-measure.md","status":"resolved","id":"ca832ed6bc22f728","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch13/58-df-measure.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch13/58-df-measure.md","status":"resolved","id":"ca832ed6bc22f728","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{Measure}_S\\subseteq V^3$（见 [[../batch13/58-df-measure.md]]）","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"X,\\Sigma,\\mu \\in V","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Measure}_S\\subseteq V^3","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{ZfcMeasure3FiniteMeasure}_S \\subseteq V^3","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}measure3\\text{-}finite\\text{-}measure} \\vdash \\mathrm{ZfcMeasure3FiniteMeasure}_S(X,\\Sigma,\\mu)\\leftrightarrow \\mathrm{Measure}_S(\\mu,X,\\Sigma)\\land \\mu(X)<\\infty","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Measure}_S","display":false}],"bytes":877,"backlinks":[{"id":"84daad544872cc71","anchor":"ref-2581","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[../batch09/58-df-zfc-measure3-finite-measure.md|58-df-zfc-measure3-finite-measure]]（batch09）"}],"outgoing":["ca832ed6bc22f728"]}